{% doc %}
  @prompt
    You can use this prompt directly with **Shopify AI (Horizon/AI Section Generator)**. It is written to recreate your hero section as closely as possible while adding the animations and background media functionality you requested.
    
    ---
    
    # Shopify AI Prompt
    
    Create a premium, full-width hero banner section that exactly matches the uploaded design. The section should be 100% responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile while maintaining the same spacing, typography, and visual hierarchy.
    
    ## Layout
    
    * Full viewport height (90-100vh)
    * Maximum content width: 1400px
    * Center the content horizontally and vertically
    * Text aligned center
    * Objects positioned around the content exactly like the reference
    
    ## Background
    
    Create a custom background media picker.
    
    Merchant can choose between:
    
    * Background Image
    * Background Video (MP4)
    * YouTube Video
    * Vimeo Video
    
    If video is selected:
    
    * autoplay
    * muted
    * loop
    * playsinline
    * no controls
    * cover entire section
    * dark overlay 55-70%
    
    If image is selected:
    
    * object-fit cover
    * full width
    * overlay opacity slider
    
    Background settings:
    
    * Background type selector
    * Image picker
    * Video picker
    * YouTube URL
    * Vimeo URL
    * Overlay color
    * Overlay opacity
    * Blur amount
    * Gradient overlay toggle
    
    ---
    
    ## Floating 3D Icons
    
    Create four independent floating objects.
    
    Merchant can upload custom PNG/WebP images.
    
    Icons:
    
    Top Left
    
    Top Right
    
    Bottom Left
    
    Bottom Right
    
    Each icon should animate independently.
    
    Animation:
    
    Floating up and down
    
    Rotate slowly
    
    Small side movement
    
    Scale 100% → 104% →100%
    
    Duration:
    6-10 seconds
    
    Random delay
    
    Infinite
    
    Ease-in-out
    
    Hover:
    
    Scale to 110%
    
    Slight glow
    
    Smooth transition
    
    Merchant settings:
    
    Image picker
    
    Width desktop
    
    Width mobile
    
    X position
    
    Y position
    
    Rotation
    
    Animation speed
    
    Animation toggle
    
    ---
    
    ## Animated Network Background
    
    Behind everything create animated glowing particles connected by thin lines.
    
    Style:
    
    Orange glow
    
    Tiny dots
    
    Moving particles
    
    Connecting lines
    
    Very subtle
    
    Low opacity
    
    No performance issues
    
    CSS animation only.
    
    ---
    
    ## Main Heading
    
    Large bold white heading.
    
    Font:
    
    Inter
    
    Poppins
    
    SF Pro Display
    
    Weight:
    700-800
    
    Desktop:
    
    72px
    
    Tablet:
    
    54px
    
    Mobile:
    
    38px
    
    Heading animation:
    
    Fade Up
    
    Move upward
    
    Opacity 0 →100%
    
    Duration:
    1 second
    
    Delay:
    0.2s
    
    ---
    
    ## Paragraph
    
    Centered below heading.
    
    Maximum width:
    
    650px
    
    White
    
    Opacity 85%
    
    Size:
    
    22px desktop
    
    18px tablet
    
    16px mobile
    
    Animation:
    
    Fade Up
    
    0.4s delay
    
    ---
    
    ## Buttons
    
    Two CTA buttons.
    
    Primary Button
    
    Blue to Orange gradient
    
    Rounded pill
    
    Height 58px
    
    Padding 34px
    
    White text
    
    Arrow icon
    
    Hover:
    
    Gradient moves
    
    Lift 3px
    
    Shadow
    
    Secondary Button
    
    Dark transparent
    
    White border
    
    Play icon
    
    White text
    
    Hover:
    
    Background becomes white
    
    Text black
    
    Lift animation
    
    Buttons animate:
    
    Fade Up
    
    0.6 second delay
    
    ---
    
    ## Entrance Animations
    
    When section loads:
    
    Background fades in
    
    Icons float into place
    
    Heading fades up
    
    Paragraph fades up
    
    Buttons fade up
    
    Entire animation lasts under 2 seconds.
    
    ---
    
    ## Mouse Interaction
    
    Desktop only.
    
    Icons slightly move following mouse.
    
    Maximum movement:
    
    20px
    
    Smooth easing
    
    No lag
    
    ---
    
    ## Scroll Animation
    
    When user scrolls:
    
    Background moves slower
    
    Icons move at different speeds
    
    Parallax effect
    
    Text remains readable
    
    ---
    
    ## Section Settings
    
    Merchant should be able to change:
    
    Heading
    
    Description
    
    Primary button text
    
    Primary button URL
    
    Secondary button text
    
    Secondary button URL
    
    Heading color
    
    Paragraph color
    
    Gradient colors
    
    Button radius
    
    Content max width
    
    Section height
    
    Overlay opacity
    
    Animation enable/disable
    
    Animation speed
    
    Particle enable/disable
    
    Floating icons enable/disable
    
    Background image
    
    Background video
    
    ---
    
    ## Performance
    
    * Lazy load images
    * Responsive images
    * Video preload metadata only
    * Hardware accelerated transforms
    * CSS animations only where possible
    * No layout shift
    * Optimized for Core Web Vitals
    * Mobile optimized
    
    ---
    
    ## Accessibility
    
    * Proper semantic HTML
    * Keyboard accessible buttons
    * Alt text for uploaded icons
    * Reduced motion support
    * WCAG AA contrast
    
    ---
    
    ## Overall Design Style
    
    Recreate the reference exactly with:
    
    * Premium SaaS aesthetic
    * Luxury ecommerce agency look
    * Dark cinematic background
    * Bright orange glowing particle network
    * Large centered white typography
    * Floating glass 3D icons
    * Soft glows
    * Smooth premium animations similar to Apple, Stripe, Linear, and Framer websites.
    
    This prompt gives Shopify AI enough detail to generate a highly polished, customizable hero section with animated floating icons, animated text, and support for both background images and videos.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.section_height }}vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #000000;
  }

  .ai-hero-background-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: ai-hero-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 1s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .ai-hero-background-media-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-hero-background-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.overlay_color }};
    opacity: {{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .ai-hero-particles-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    z-index: 3;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .ai-hero-particle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.particle_color }};
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px {{ block.settings.particle_color }};
  }

  .ai-hero-particle-line-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, {{ block.settings.particle_color }}, transparent);
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-hero-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.content_max_width }}px;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 5;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .ai-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 30px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1));
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, filter 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover img {
    transform: scale(1.1);
    filter: drop-shadow(0 15px 40px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2));
  }

  .ai-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: 72px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: ai-hero-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} 1s ease-out 0.2s forwards;
  }

  .ai-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.paragraph_color }};
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: ai-hero-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} 1s ease-out 0.4s forwards;
  }

  .ai-hero-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px);
    animation: ai-hero-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} 1s ease-out 0.6s forwards;
  }

  .ai-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 0 34px;
    height: 58px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{ block.settings.gradient_color_1 }}, {{ block.settings.gradient_color_2 }});
    background-size: 200% 200%;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_radius }}px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-position: right center;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 120, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .ai-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 0 34px;
    height: 58px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_radius }}px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .ai-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #000000;
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  .ai-hero-icon-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .ai-hero-icon-play-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  @keyframes ai-hero-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  @keyframes ai-hero-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes ai-hero-float-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg) scale(1);
    }
    25% {
      transform: translate(10px, -15px) rotate(5deg) scale(1.04);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translate(-5px, -25px) rotate(-3deg) scale(1.02);
    }
    75% {
      transform: translate(-10px, -15px) rotate(3deg) scale(1.04);
    }
  }

  @keyframes ai-hero-float-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg) scale(1);
    }
    25% {
      transform: translate(-12px, -20px) rotate(-4deg) scale(1.03);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translate(8px, -30px) rotate(4deg) scale(1.04);
    }
    75% {
      transform: translate(12px, -18px) rotate(-5deg) scale(1.02);
    }
  }

  @keyframes ai-hero-float-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg) scale(1);
    }
    25% {
      transform: translate(8px, -18px) rotate(3deg) scale(1.02);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translate(-10px, -28px) rotate(-4deg) scale(1.04);
    }
    75% {
      transform: translate(10px, -20px) rotate(5deg) scale(1.03);
    }
  }

  @keyframes ai-hero-float-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: translate(0, 0) rotate(0deg) scale(1);
    }
    25% {
      transform: translate(-8px, -22px) rotate(-5deg) scale(1.04);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translate(12px, -32px) rotate(3deg) scale(1.02);
    }
    75% {
      transform: translate(-12px, -20px) rotate(4deg) scale(1.03);
    }
  }

  @keyframes ai-hero-particle-move-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0%, 100% {
      transform: translate(0, 0);
    }
    50% {
      transform: translate(var(--ai-particle-x), var(--ai-particle-y));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 54px;
    }

    .ai-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 18px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: {{ block.settings.section_height | times: 0.8 }}vh;
    }

    .ai-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 38px;
    }

    .ai-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .ai-hero-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 300px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .ai-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} *,
    .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::before,
    .ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} *::after {
      animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
      transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<premium-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-hero-background-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.background_type == 'image' and block.settings.background_image %}
      <img
        src="{{ block.settings.background_image | image_url: width: 2400 }}"
        alt="{{ block.settings.background_image.alt | escape }}"
        class="ai-hero-background-media-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        loading="eager"
        width="{{ block.settings.background_image.width }}"
        height="{{ block.settings.background_image.height }}"
      >
    {% elsif block.settings.background_type == 'video' and block.settings.background_video %}
      <video
        class="ai-hero-background-media-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        preload="metadata"
      >
        <source src="{{ block.settings.background_video }}" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
    {% elsif block.settings.background_type == 'youtube' and block.settings.youtube_url != blank %}
      <iframe
        class="ai-hero-background-media-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/{{ block.settings.youtube_url | split: 'v=' | last | split: '&' | first }}?autoplay=1&mute=1&loop=1&controls=0&showinfo=0&rel=0&modestbranding=1&playsinline=1&playlist={{ block.settings.youtube_url | split: 'v=' | last | split: '&' | first }}"
        frameborder="0"
        allow="autoplay; encrypted-media"
      ></iframe>
    {% elsif block.settings.background_type == 'vimeo' and block.settings.vimeo_url != blank %}
      <iframe
        class="ai-hero-background-media-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/{{ block.settings.vimeo_url | split: '/' | last }}?autoplay=1&muted=1&loop=1&background=1&controls=0"
        frameborder="0"
        allow="autoplay; fullscreen"
      ></iframe>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="ai-hero-background-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
  </div>

  {% if block.settings.particles_enabled %}
    <canvas class="ai-hero-particles-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-particle-color="{{ block.settings.particle_color }}"></canvas>
  {% endif %}

  {% if block.settings.floating_icons_enabled %}
    {% if block.settings.icon_top_left %}
      <div
        class="ai-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-hero-icon-tl-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        style="
          top: {{ block.settings.icon_top_left_y }}%;
          left: {{ block.settings.icon_top_left_x }}%;
          width: {{ block.settings.icon_top_left_width }}px;
          animation: ai-hero-float-1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {{ block.settings.animation_speed }}s ease-in-out infinite;
          animation-delay: 0s;
          animation-fill-mode: forwards;
          opacity: 1;
        "
        data-parallax-speed="0.3"
      >
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.icon_top_left | image_url: width: 400 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.icon_top_left.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.icon_top_left_width }}"
          height="auto"
        >
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.icon_top_right %}
      <div
        class="ai-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-hero-icon-tr-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        style="
          top: {{ block.settings.icon_top_right_y }}%;
          right: {{ block.settings.icon_top_right_x }}%;
          width: {{ block.settings.icon_top_right_width }}px;
          animation: ai-hero-float-2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {{ block.settings.animation_speed }}s ease-in-out infinite;
          animation-delay: 0.5s;
          animation-fill-mode: forwards;
          opacity: 1;
        "
        data-parallax-speed="0.4"
      >
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.icon_top_right | image_url: width: 400 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.icon_top_right.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.icon_top_right_width }}"
          height="auto"
        >
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.icon_bottom_left %}
      <div
        class="ai-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-hero-icon-bl-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        style="
          bottom: {{ block.settings.icon_bottom_left_y }}%;
          left: {{ block.settings.icon_bottom_left_x }}%;
          width: {{ block.settings.icon_bottom_left_width }}px;
          animation: ai-hero-float-3-{{ ai_gen_id }} {{ block.settings.animation_speed }}s ease-in-out infinite;
          animation-delay: 1s;
          animation-fill-mode: forwards;
          opacity: 1;
        "
        data-parallax-speed="0.5"
      >
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.icon_bottom_left | image_url: width: 400 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.icon_bottom_left.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.icon_bottom_left_width }}"
          height="auto"
        >
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.icon_bottom_right %}
      <div
        class="ai-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-hero-icon-br-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        style="
          bottom: {{ block.settings.icon_bottom_right_y }}%;
          right: {{ block.settings.icon_bottom_right_x }}%;
          width: {{ block.settings.icon_bottom_right_width }}px;
          animation: ai-hero-float-4-{{ ai_gen_id }} {{ block.settings.animation_speed }}s ease-in-out infinite;
          animation-delay: 1.5s;
          animation-fill-mode: forwards;
          opacity: 1;
        "
        data-parallax-speed="0.6"
      >
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.icon_bottom_right | image_url: width: 400 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.icon_bottom_right.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.icon_bottom_right_width }}"
          height="auto"
        >
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-hero-content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h1 class="ai-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h1>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
      <div class="ai-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description }}</div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-hero-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.primary_button_text != blank %}
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.primary_button_url }}"
          class="ai-hero-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.primary_button_text }}
          <svg class="ai-hero-icon-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.secondary_button_text != blank %}
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.secondary_button_url }}"
          class="ai-hero-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          <svg class="ai-hero-icon-play-{{ ai_gen_id }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
            <path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/>
          </svg>
          {{ block.settings.secondary_button_text }}
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</premium-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class PremiumHero{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.particlesEnabled = {{ block.settings.particles_enabled | json }};
        this.parallaxEnabled = window.innerWidth > 749;
        this.mouseX = 0;
        this.mouseY = 0;
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        if (this.particlesEnabled) {
          this.initParticles();
        }

        if (this.parallaxEnabled) {
          this.initParallax();
          this.initMouseFollow();
        }

        this.initScrollParallax();
      }

      initParticles() {
        const canvas = this.querySelector('.ai-hero-particles-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        if (!canvas) return;

        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
        canvas.width = this.offsetWidth;
        canvas.height = this.offsetHeight;

        const particles = [];
        const particleCount = Math.min(50, Math.floor((canvas.width * canvas.height) / 15000));
        const particleColor = canvas.dataset.particleColor || '#ff7800';

        for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {
          particles.push({
            x: Math.random() * canvas.width,
            y: Math.random() * canvas.height,
            vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5,
            vy: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.5,
            radius: Math.random() * 2 + 1
          });
        }

        const animate = () => {
          ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);

          particles.forEach((p, i) => {
            p.x += p.vx;
            p.y += p.vy;

            if (p.x < 0 || p.x > canvas.width) p.vx *= -1;
            if (p.y < 0 || p.y > canvas.height) p.vy *= -1;

            ctx.beginPath();
            ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);
            ctx.fillStyle = particleColor;
            ctx.shadowBlur = 10;
            ctx.shadowColor = particleColor;
            ctx.fill();

            particles.forEach((p2, j) => {
              if (i === j) return;
              const dx = p.x - p2.x;
              const dy = p.y - p2.y;
              const distance = Math.sqrt(dx * dx + dy * dy);

              if (distance < 150) {
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.moveTo(p.x, p.y);
                ctx.lineTo(p2.x, p2.y);
                ctx.strokeStyle = particleColor;
                ctx.globalAlpha = (1 - distance / 150) * 0.3;
                ctx.lineWidth = 1;
                ctx.stroke();
                ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
              }
            });
          });

          requestAnimationFrame(animate);
        };

        animate();

        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
          canvas.width = this.offsetWidth;
          canvas.height = this.offsetHeight;
        });
      }

      initParallax() {
        const icons = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
          const scrolled = window.pageYOffset;
          
          icons.forEach(icon => {
            const speed = parseFloat(icon.dataset.parallaxSpeed) || 0.5;
            const yPos = -(scrolled * speed);
            icon.style.transform = `translateY(${yPos}px)`;
          });
        });
      }

      initMouseFollow() {
        const icons = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-hero-floating-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        this.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
          const rect = this.getBoundingClientRect();
          this.mouseX = (e.clientX - rect.left - rect.width / 2) / rect.width;
          this.mouseY = (e.clientY - rect.top - rect.height / 2) / rect.height;

          icons.forEach((icon, index) => {
            const moveX = this.mouseX * 20 * (index + 1) * 0.5;
            const moveY = this.mouseY * 20 * (index + 1) * 0.5;
            
            const currentTransform = icon.style.transform || '';
            const translateYMatch = currentTransform.match(/translateY\(([^)]+)\)/);
            const translateY = translateYMatch ? translateYMatch[1] : '0px';
            
            icon.style.transform = `translateY(${translateY}) translate(${moveX}px, ${moveY}px)`;
          });
        });
      }

      initScrollParallax() {
        const background = this.querySelector('.ai-hero-background-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
          const scrolled = window.pageYOffset;
          const rate = scrolled * 0.5;
          
          if (background) {
            background.style.transform = `translateY(${rate}px)`;
          }
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('premium-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}', PremiumHero{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

